    └── 账务结算

# 对应的微服务划分
服务:
├── product-service (产品管理)
├── order-service (订单处理)
├── customer-service (客户管理)
├── fulfillment-service (物流管理)
└── payment-service (支付系统)
</code></pre><h3>领域驱动设计与微服务</h3><p>领域驱动设计（DDD）为微服务划分提供了强有力的方法论支持。DDD 中的限界上下文（Bounded Context）概念直接对应微服务的边界。在限界上下文中，每个领域模型都是自包含的，与其他上下文有明确的边界。</p><p>DDD 的聚合（Aggregate）概念帮助我们确定哪些对象应该属于同一个服务。聚合是一组相关对象的集合，它们被视为数据修改的单元。通过识别聚合，我们可以确定服务的核心实体和值对象。</p><pre><code># DDD 聚合示例 - 订单聚合
// 订单聚合根
public class Order {
    private OrderId id;
    private CustomerId customerId;
    private List&lt;OrderLineItem&gt; lineItems;
    private OrderStatus status;
    private Money totalAmount;

    // 聚合根负责维护业务不变性
    public void addItem(ProductId productId, int quantity, Money price) {
        if (status != OrderStatus.DRAFT) {
            throw new OrderException("Cannot add items to confirmed order");
        }
        lineItems.add(new OrderLineItem(productId, quantity, price));
        recalculateTotal();
    }

    public void confirm() {
        if (lineItems.isEmpty()) {
            throw new OrderException("Cannot confirm empty order");
        }
        status = OrderStatus.CONFIRMED;
        DomainEvents.publish(new OrderConfirmedEvent(this));
    }

    // 其他聚合方法...
}

// 聚合边界：Order 聚合包含 OrderLineItem，但不能直接访问 Customer 的内部状态
// 跨聚合引用使用 ID 而不是对象引用
</code></pre><h2 id="saga-pattern">Saga 分布式事务模式</h2><p>在微服务架构中，每个服务拥有自己的数据库，传统的 ACID 事务无法跨服务边界工作。Saga 模式提供了一种在分布式环境中实现数据一致性的机制。</p><h3>Saga 的基本概念</h3><p>Saga 将一个分布式事务分解为一系列本地事务，每个本地事务完成后发布一个事件触发下一个事务。如果某个步骤失败，Saga 会执行一系列补偿事务来撤销之前的操作。</p><p>Saga 有两种主要的实现方式： choreography（编排）和 orchestration（编排器）。编排型 Saga 通过服务间的消息传递来协调事务，适合简单的场景。编排器型 Saga 通过一个中央编排器来控制整个事务流程，适合复杂的业务流程。</p><h3>编排型 Saga 实现</h3><pre><code>// 订单服务 - 编排型 Saga
@Service
public class OrderService {

    @Autowired
    private OrderRepository orderRepository;

    @Autowired
    private EventPublisher eventPublisher;

    @Transactional
    public Order createOrder(CreateOrderCommand command) {
        Order order = Order.create(command.getCustomerId(), command.getItems());
        orderRepository.save(order);

        // 发布事件触发 Saga
        eventPublisher.publish(new OrderCreatedEvent(
            order.getId(),
            order.getCustomerId(),
            order.getTotalAmount()
        ));

        return order;
    }

    @SagaStart
    @EventListener(condition = "event.eventType=='CREATE_ORDER'")
    public void handleCreateOrderSaga(OrderCreatedEvent event) {
        // Saga 自动开始执行
    }
}

// 支付服务
@Service
public class PaymentService {

    @Autowired
    private PaymentRepository paymentRepository;

    @EventListener
    public void handleOrderCreated(OrderCreatedEvent event) {
        // 执行本地事务：创建支付记录
        Payment payment = paymentService.processPayment(
            event.getCustomerId(),
            event.getOrderId(),
            event.getAmount()
        );

        if (payment.isSuccessful()) {
            eventPublisher.publish(new PaymentCompletedEvent(
                event.getOrderId(),
                payment.getId()
            ));
        } else {
            eventPublisher.publish(new PaymentFailedEvent(
                event.getOrderId(),
                payment.getFailureReason()
            ));
        }
    }
}

// 库存服务
@Service
public class InventoryService {

    @EventListener
    public void handlePaymentCompleted(PaymentCompletedEvent event) {
        // 预留库存
        boolean reserved = inventoryService.reserveStock(event.getOrderId());

        if (reserved) {
            eventPublisher.publish(new StockReservedEvent(event.getOrderId()));
        } else {
            eventPublisher.publish(new StockReservationFailedEvent(
                event.getOrderId(),
                "Insufficient stock"
            ));
        }
    }
}
</code></pre><h3>编排器型 Saga 实现</h3><pre><code>// Saga 编排器
public class OrderSagaOrchestrator {

    private final OrderService orderService;
    private final PaymentService paymentService;
    private final InventoryService inventoryService;
    private final ShippingService shippingService;

    @Autowired
    public OrderSagaOrchestrator(
            OrderService orderService,
            PaymentService paymentService,
            InventoryService inventoryService,
            ShippingService shippingService) {
        this.orderService = orderService;
        this.paymentService = paymentService;
        this.inventoryService = inventoryService;
        this.shippingService = shippingService;
    }

    public void executeOrderSaga(CreateOrderCommand command) {
        SagaContext context = new SagaContext();

        try {
            // Step 1: 创建订单
            Order order = orderService.createOrder(command);
            context.setOrderId(order.getId());

            // Step 2: 扣款
            Payment payment = paymentService.charge(
                context.getOrderId(),
                command.getCustomerId(),
                order.getTotalAmount()
            );
            context.setPaymentId(payment.getId());

            // Step 3: 预留库存
            inventoryService.reserve(context.getOrderId(), order.getItems());

            // Step 4: 创建物流
            shippingService.createShipment(context.getOrderId());

            // Step 5: 确认订单
            orderService.confirmOrder(context.getOrderId());

        } catch (PaymentException e) {
            // 补偿：取消订单
            orderService.cancelOrder(context.getOrderId(), "Payment failed");
        } catch (InventoryException e) {
            // 补偿：退款
            paymentService.refund(context.getPaymentId());
            orderService.cancelOrder(context.getOrderId(), "Inventory unavailable");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            // 通用补偿逻辑
            compensate(context);
        }
    }

    private void compensate(SagaContext context) {
        if (context.getShipmentId() != null) {
            shippingService.cancelShipment(context.getShipmentId());
        }
        inventoryService.releaseReservation(context.getOrderId());
        if (context.getPaymentId() != null) {
            paymentService.refund(context.getPaymentId());
        }
        if (context.getOrderId() != null) {
            orderService.cancelOrder(context.getOrderId(), "Saga compensation");
        }
    }
}
</code></pre><h3>Saga 的补偿策略</h3><p>Saga 的补偿事务需要注意幂等性、可逆性和业务规则。由于 Saga 是最终一致性，在补偿过程中可能出现新的失败，需要设计健壮的补偿逻辑。补偿顺序通常与正向事务相反，但某些场景下可能有更优的补偿顺序。</p><h2 id="cqrs-pattern">CQRS 读写分离模式</h2><p>CQRS（Command Query Responsibility Segregation，命令查询职责分离）是一种将读写操作分离的架构模式。在微服务架构中，不同服务可能有不同的读写需求，CQRS 可以帮助优化这种不对称性。</p><h3>CQRS 核心概念</h3><p>CQRS 的核心思想是使用不同的模型来处理读取（查询）和写入（命令）操作。写入模型负责处理业务逻辑和维护数据一致性，读模型则针对查询进行优化，可以是高度规范化的、专门为查询设计的结构。</p><p>CQRS 特别适合以下场景：读写负载差异显著、写操作复杂但读操作简单、需要高并发的查询能力、查询结果需要聚合来自多个服务的数据。</p><h3>CQRS 实现</h3><pre><code>// 命令端 - 处理写入操作
public class OrderCommandHandler {

    private final EventStore eventStore;
    private final EventPublisher eventPublisher;

    public void handle(CreateOrderCommand command) {
        Order order = new Order(
            command.getOrderId(),
            command.getCustomerId()
        );

        for (OrderItemCommand item : command.getItems()) {
            order.addItem(item.getProductId(), item.getQuantity());
        }

        // 保存事件
        List&lt;DomainEvent&gt; events = order.getUncommittedEvents();
        eventStore.saveEvents(order.getId(), events);

        // 发布事件更新读模型
        for (DomainEvent event : events) {
            eventPublisher.publish(event);
        }
    }
}

// 查询端 - 优化的读模型
public class OrderQueryModel {

    @Data
    public static class OrderSummary {
        private String orderId;
        private String customerName;
        private String status;
        private List&lt;OrderItemSummary&gt; items;
        private Money totalAmount;
        private Instant createdAt;
        private String shippingAddress;
        // 其他查询需要的字段
    }

    @Data
    public static class OrderItemSummary {
        private String productName;
        private int quantity;
        private Money unitPrice;
        private Money subtotal;
    }
}

// 查询处理器 - 更新读模型
@Component
public class OrderQueryUpdater {

    @Autowired
    private JdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate;

    @EventListener
    public void onOrderCreated(OrderCreatedEvent event) {
        String sql = """
            INSERT INTO order_read_model 
            (order_id, customer_id, status, created_at)
            VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
            """;
        jdbcTemplate.update(sql, 
            event.getOrderId(),
            event.getCustomerId(),
            "CREATED",
            Instant.now()
        );
    }

    @EventListener
    public void onPaymentCompleted(PaymentCompletedEvent event) {
        String sql = """
            UPDATE order_read_model 
            SET status = ?, updated_at = ?
            WHERE order_id = ?
            """;
        jdbcTemplate.update(sql, 
            "PAID",
            Instant.now(),
            event.getOrderId()
        );
    }
}

// 查询 API - 针对查询优化
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/orders")
public class OrderQueryController {

    @Autowired
    private OrderQueryRepository queryRepository;

    @GetMapping("/{orderId}")
    public OrderSummary getOrderSummary(@PathVariable String orderId) {
        return queryRepository.findOrderSummary(orderId);
    }

    @GetMapping("/customer/{customerId}")
    public List&lt;OrderSummary&gt; getCustomerOrders(
            @PathVariable String customerId,
            @RequestParam(defaultValue = "0") int page,
            @RequestParam(defaultValue = "20") int size) {
        return queryRepository.findByCustomerId(customerId, page, size);
    }

    @GetMapping("/search")
    public Page&lt;OrderSummary&gt; searchOrders(
            @RequestParam(required = false) String status,
            @RequestParam(required = false) @DateTimeFormat(iso = ISO.DATE) LocalDate fromDate,
            @RequestParam(required = false) @DateTimeFormat(iso = ISO.DATE) LocalDate toDate,
            Pageable pageable) {
        return queryRepository.search(status, fromDate, toDate, pageable);
    }
}
</code></pre><h2 id="event-sourcing">事件溯源模式</h2><p>事件溯源（Event Sourcing）是一种将状态变更存储为一系列有序事件的模式。与传统的关系型存储不同，事件溯源存储的是业务事件，而不是当前状态快照。</p><h3>事件溯源的优势</h3><p>事件溯源提供了完整的审计跟踪，所有状态变更都被记录为不可变的事件。通过重放事件，可以重建任何时间点的状态。事件溯源天然支持时间旅行查询，可以查询

。事件日志可以作为分析数据源，支持商业智能分析。由于事件是事实的记录，可以解耦事件生产者和消费者。</p><h3>事件溯源实现</h3><pre><code>// 事件存储库
public class EventStore {

    private final JdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate;
    private final ObjectMapper objectMapper;

    public void saveEvents(String aggregateId, List&lt;DomainEvent&gt; events) {
        String sql = """
            INSERT INTO events (aggregate_id, event_type, event_data, created_at)
            VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
            """;

        for (DomainEvent event : events) {
            String eventData = objectMapper.writeValueAsString(event);
            jdbcTemplate.update(sql, 
                aggregateId,
                event.getClass().getSimpleName(),
                eventData,
                Instant.now()
            );
        }
    }

    public List&lt;DomainEvent&gt; loadEvents(String aggregateId) {
        String sql = "SELECT event_type, event_data FROM events " +
                     "WHERE aggregate_id = ? ORDER BY created_at ASC";

        List&lt;DomainEvent&gt; events = jdbcTemplate.query(sql,
            (rs, rowNum) -> {
                String eventType = rs.getString("event_type");
                String eventData = rs.getString("event_data");
                return deserialize(eventType, eventData);
            },
            aggregateId
        );

        return events;
    }
}

// 带事件溯源的聚合根
public class BankAccount extends AggregateRoot {

    private String accountId;
    private String customerId;
    private Money balance;

    public BankAccount(String accountId, String customerId, Money initialDeposit) {
        apply(new AccountCreatedEvent(accountId, customerId, initialDeposit));
    }

    // 从事件重建聚合
    public BankAccount(List&lt;DomainEvent&gt; events) {
        for (DomainEvent event : events) {
            apply(event);
        }
    }

    public void deposit(Money amount) {
        if (amount.isNegativeOrZero()) {
            throw new InvalidAmountException("Deposit amount must be positive");
        }
        apply(new MoneyDepositedEvent(accountId, amount));
    }

    public void withdraw(Money amount) {
        if (amount.isNegativeOrZero()) {
            throw new InvalidAmountException("Withdrawal amount must be positive");
        }
        if (balance.isLessThan(amount)) {
            throw new InsufficientFundsException(accountId, amount, balance);
        }
        apply(new MoneyWithdrawnEvent(accountId, amount));
    }

    // 事件处理方法
    private void apply(DomainEvent event) {
        if (event instanceof AccountCreatedEvent e) {
            this.accountId = e.getAccountId();
            this.customerId = e.getCustomerId();
            this.balance = e.getInitialBalance();
        } else if (event instanceof MoneyDepositedEvent e) {
            this.balance = this.balance.add(e.getAmount());
        } else if (event instanceof MoneyWithdrawnEvent e) {
            this.balance = this.balance.subtract(e.getAmount());
        }

        // 将事件添加到未提交列表
        uncommittedEvents.add(event);
    }
}

// 快照优化
public class SnapshotStore {

    public void saveSnapshot(String aggregateId, int version, BankAccount snapshot) {
        String sql = """
            INSERT INTO snapshots (aggregate_id, version, snapshot_data, created_at)
            VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)
            """;
        String snapshotData = objectMapper.writeValueAsString(snapshot);
        jdbcTemplate.update(sql, aggregateId, version, snapshotData, Instant.now());
    }

    public Optional&lt;Snapshot&gt; loadLatestSnapshot(String aggregateId) {
        String sql = "SELECT version, snapshot_data FROM snapshots " +
                     "WHERE aggregate_id = ? ORDER BY version DESC LIMIT 1";
        // 实现快照加载逻辑
    }
}
</code></pre><h2 id="api-gateway">API 网关模式</h2><p>API 网关是微服务架构中的统一入口点，它负责请求路由、协议转换、聚合和跨切面关注点（如认证、限流、日志）。</p><h3>API 网关职责</h3><p>API 网关的主要职责包括请求路由，将请求转发到对应的后端服务；协议转换，在 HTTP/gRPC、WebSocket 等协议间转换；请求聚合，将多个微服务的响应合并为单一响应；认证授权，集中处理身份验证和访问控制；限流熔断，保护后端服务免受流量冲击；日志监控，记录请求日志用于监控和分析；协议降级，在服务故障时返回降级响应。</p><pre><code># Kong API 网关配置示例
# 服务定义
curl -X POST http://kong:8001/services \
  -d "name=order-service" \
  -d "url=http://order-service:8080"

# 路由定义
curl -X POST http://kong:8001/services/order-service/routes \
  -d "name=order-route" \
  -d "paths[]=/api/orders" \
  -d "methods=GET,POST" \
  -d "strip_path=false"

# JWT 认证插件
curl -X POST http://kong:8001/services/order-service/plugins \
  -d "name=jwt" \
  -d "config.secret_is_base64=false" \
  -d "config.claims_to_verify=exp"

# 限流插件
curl -X POST http://kong:8001/services/order-service/plugins \
  -d "name=rate-limiting" \
  -d "config.minute=100" \
  -d "config.policy=local"

# CORS 插件
curl -X POST http://kong:8001/services/order-service/plugins \
  -d "name=cors" \
  -d "config.origins=*" \
  -d "config.methods=GET,POST,PUT,DELETE" \
  -d "config.headers=Content-Type,Authorization" \
  -d "config.exposed_headers=X-Total-Count" \
  -d "config.credentials=true"
</code></pre><h2 id="circuit-breaker">熔断器与限流</h2><p>在分布式系统中，服务故障是常态而非例外。熔断器（Circuit Breaker）模式防止故障级联传播，限流（Rate Limiting）模式保护系统不被过载。</p><h3>熔断器实现</h3><pre><code>public class CircuitBreaker {

    private final String name;
    private final CircuitBreakerConfig config;
    private CircuitState state = CircuitState.CLOSED;
    private int failureCount = 0;
    private int successCount = 0;
    private Instant lastFailureTime;

    public enum CircuitState {
        CLOSED,    // 正常，允许请求通过
        OPEN,      // 熔断，拒绝所有请求
        HALF_OPEN  // 半开，允许部分请求尝试
    }

    public &lt;T&gt; T execute(Supplier&lt;T&gt; operation, Supplier&lt;T&gt; fallback) {
        if (!allowRequest()) {
            return fallback.get();
        }

        try {
            T result = operation.get();
            onSuccess();
            return result;
        } catch (Exception e) {
            onFailure(e);
            return fallback.get();
        }
    }

    private boolean allowRequest() {
        switch (state) {
            case CLOSED:
                return true;
            case OPEN:
                if (isTimeOutElapsed()) {
                    state = CircuitState.HALF_OPEN;
                    return true;
                }
                return false;
            case HALF_OPEN:
                return true;
            default:
                return false;
        }
    }

    private void onSuccess() {
        failureCount = 0;
        if (state == CircuitState.HALF_OPEN) {
            successCount++;
            if (successCount &gt;= config.getSuccessThreshold()) {
                state = CircuitState.CLOSED;
                successCount = 0;
            }
        }
    }

    private void onFailure(Exception e) {
        failureCount++;
        lastFailureTime = Instant.now();

        if (state == CircuitState.HALF_OPEN) {
            state = CircuitState.OPEN;
        } else if (failureCount &gt;= config.getFailureThreshold()) {
            state = CircuitState.OPEN;
        }
    }

    private boolean isTimeOutElapsed() {
        return lastFailureTime.plusMillis(config.getResetTimeout()).isBefore(Instant.now());
    }
}

// 熔断器配置
public class CircuitBreakerConfig {
    private int failureThreshold = 5;
    private int successThreshold = 3;
    private long resetTimeoutMs = 60000;

    public static CircuitBreakerConfig custom() {
        return new CircuitBreakerConfig();
    }

    public CircuitBreakerConfig failureThreshold(int threshold) {
        this.failureThreshold = threshold;
        return this;
    }

    public CircuitBreakerConfig resetTimeout(long millis) {
        this.resetTimeoutMs = millis;
        return this;
    }
}
</code></pre><p>微服务架构设计模式是应对分布式系统挑战的重要工具。通过合理运用 Saga 模式解决分布式事务问题、CQRS 模式优化读写分离、事件溯源提供完整审计跟踪、API 网关实现统一入口、熔断器保护系统稳定性，我们可以构建出既灵活又可靠的微服务系统。这些模式并非孤立使用，在实际项目中往往需要组合多种模式来满足复杂的业务需求。理解这些模式的原理和适用场景，是成为微服务架构师的关键技能。</p>
